meta {
  name: replace testimonial
  type: http
  seq: 37
}

put {
  url: {{base_url}}/administrator/testimonials/:id/
  body: json
  auth: inherit
}

params:path {
  id: 9a7b6c5d-4e3f-2a1b-0c9d-8e7f6a5b4c3d
}

body:json {
  {
    // Required.
    "student_name": "Emma",
    // Required. Must state a specific outcome.
    "outcome_en": "After 8 weeks with Lucia I held a full conversation with my partner's family in Guayaquil -- no English at all.",

    // Optional; omitting resets to the default shown.
    "country": "United Kingdom",
    "photo_url": "",
    "outcome_es": "",
    "rating": 5,
    "programme": "Online Classes",
    "active": true,
    "sort_order": 0
  }
}

docs {
  ## API explanation
  `PUT` **replaces** the record: any writable field you leave out is reset to its
  default or blank, not left alone. Use `PATCH` (see **update testimonial**) unless you are
  deliberately sending the whole object -- an edit form that omits a field will
  silently wipe it.

  ## API example response
  {
    "id": "9a7b6c5d-4e3f-2a1b-0c9d-8e7f6a5b4c3d",
    "student_name": "Emma",
    "country": "United Kingdom",
    "rating": 5,
    "active": true,
    "sort_order": 0,
    "lang": "en",
    "updated_at": "2026-09-12T10:20:00.000000-05:00"
  }
}
